---
// Toolbox — three drawers: daily reach, and as-needed.
---
<section id="toolbox" class="relative bg-paper-deep/40">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 md:py-32">
    <p
      class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase"
    >
      <span class="inline-block h-px w-10 bg-ink/30"></span>
      Station 03 &mdash; The Toolbox
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
    >
      Tools within <em class="font-light">reach.</em>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"
      style="--reveal-delay: 160ms"
    >
      Not a badge wall &mdash; the actual drawer contents. What gets reached for every day,
      and what&rsquo;s there when the job calls for it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6">
      <!-- Drawer 01 — Build -->
      <div class="reveal work-card relative p-7">
        <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-8 -rotate-3"></div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
          Drawer 01 &mdash; Build
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Laravel</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-marker">PHP &middot; daily driver</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Flutter</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">Poka&rsquo;s home</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Go</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">backend & CLI</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-dashed border-ink/15 pt-5">
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">Dart</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">Node.js</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Drawer 02 — Store -->
      <div class="reveal work-card relative p-7" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
        <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-8 rotate-2"></div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
          Drawer 02 &mdash; Store
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">PostgreSQL</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">where Poka lives</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Redis</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">hot cache</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">MySQL</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">old reliable</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-dashed border-ink/15 pt-5">
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">SQLite</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Drawer 03 — Run -->
      <div class="reveal work-card relative p-7" style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
        <div class="tape -top-3.5 left-8 -rotate-2"></div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
          Drawer 03 &mdash; Run
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Ubuntu Linux</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">home turf</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Docker</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">ships everything</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Cloudflare</p>
            <p class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">the front door</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t border-dashed border-ink/15 pt-5">
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">WAF</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">mail servers</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">Grafana</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">Netdata</span>
          <span class="rounded-sm border border-ink/12 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-soft">CLI tooling</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-10 rotate-[-1deg] font-hand text-2xl text-ink-faint">
      ...and whatever the next job requires. tools are means, not the point.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
